 es-core/src/components/VideoComponent.cpp    | 36 +++++++++++++++++++-
 es-core/src/components/VideoComponent.h      |  5 +++
 es-core/src/components/VideoVlcComponent.cpp | 32 ++++++++++++++---
 4 files changed, 71 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

